; Taxi Cam Setup wording. English is the source; each language in [Languages]
; of taxi-cam.iss has a file with the same keys. %1 is filled in by Setup.

[CustomMessages]
StartupOptionInvalid=The /STARTUP option must be automatic or manual.
InstallFailed=Installation failed. Close MSFS and the companion and verify the selected paths.
SimulatorPageDescription=Select the simulator Content directory
SimulatorPageSubCaption=Choose the directory containing FlightSimulator2024.exe.
SimulatorFolderLabel=Simulator Content directory:
StartupPageCaption=Startup preference
StartupPageDescription=Choose how to start Taxi Cam
StartupPageSubCaption=Automatic startup can be retried by running setup again. If setup cannot safely configure it, Taxi Cam will still be installed for manual launch.
StartupAutomatic=Configure automatic startup with MSFS
StartupManual=Launch manually; leave existing startup entries unchanged
XmlPageCaption=Automatic startup
XmlPageDescription=Select the simulator exe.xml
XmlPageSubCaption=Setup preserves other startup entries and adds Taxi Cam. A new exe.xml can be created at the selected path.
XmlFileLabel=Simulator launch configuration:
XmlFileFilter=XML files|*.xml|All files|*.*
SettingsPageCaption=Saved settings
SettingsPageDescription=Keep your settings or start with the defaults
SettingsPageSubCaption=Keep your camera profiles, calibration, reference guides and keyboard shortcuts. Camera frame rate is set to 10 (minimum 5, range 5–60). Clear this box to reset saved settings to the defaults.
KeepExistingSettings=&Keep existing settings (recommended)
PreviousSettingsUnreadable=Cannot read the previous installation settings. Check installation.json.
SimulatorFolderInvalid=Select the Content directory containing FlightSimulator2024.exe.
XmlPathInvalid=Choose a full path ending in exe.xml.
ConfigureFailed=Taxi Cam was installed, but Setup could not finish configuring it: %1 Run Setup again, or open Taxi Cam from the Start menu when you use MSFS.
ManualStartupNotice=Launch Taxi Cam from the Start menu before using MSFS. Existing simulator startup entries were left unchanged. You can run setup again to configure automatic startup.
InstalledSuccessfully=Taxi Cam was installed successfully.
KeepSettingsQuestion=Keep your Taxi Cam settings?
KeepSettingsExplanation=Keep your camera profiles, calibration, reference guides and keyboard shortcuts for a future installation. Logs will be kept either way.
UninstallKeepSettings=&Keep settings (recommended)
UninstallKeepSettingsNote=Uninstall the app and keep saved settings.
UninstallRemoveSettings=&Remove saved settings
UninstallRemoveSettingsNote=Uninstall the app and remove saved settings.
UninstallCancel=&Cancel
